# Local data
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# EVERYTHING under backend/data/ is generated or user-supplied runtime data.
# It lives on disk (laptop + server), never in git:
#   - raw/        raw book PDFs (laptop-only; not required on the VM)
#   - 1/, page_images/, uploads/   rendered/uploaded page images (~GBs)
#   - chroma_db/  Chroma vector store (127MB+ sqlite + binaries; rebuilt by
#                 ingest, or scp'd to the server - see DEPLOYMENT.md)
#   - ocr/        bulk OCR text corpus
#   - rag_data.db the app's SQLite (users, mocks, attempts) - server-local
# Transfer any of these to the server via scp/rsync, never through git.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
backend/data/

# SQLite safety net (any stray app DB outside backend/data/)
*.sqlite3
*.db

# Runtime logs
*.log
backend/server_*.log

# Tooling caches / AI-agent scratch
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.kilo/
.freebuff/
debug_output.txt

# One-off local preview/design harnesses (single-file scratch HTML pages
# opened in a browser during development - never part of the app build).
*_preview.html
# Figma Make design harness - optional, vite.config.ts reads it only if it
# exists. Never part of the app build.
frontend/.figma/
nohup.out

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Laptop-only: GPU OCR fleet + tooling. NOT needed on the server.
# (If any of these were committed earlier, gitignore alone won't untrack
#  them - use: git rm -r --cached <path>)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
ocr-workers/
ocr-kit/
ocr-output/
scanned-pending/
*.bat

# Laptop-only scripts (GPU EasyOCR fleet / bulk transcription drivers).
# The server needs none of these - retrieval uses separately uploaded data.
backend/scripts/bulk_easyocr.py
backend/scripts/bulk_tesseract.py
backend/scripts/run_question_bank.py
backend/scripts/bench_ocr_engines.py
# OCR engine benchmark artifacts (per-page txt dumps)
backend/scripts/bench_out/

# AI-assistant workspace docs (for coding agents, not the app)
frontend/AGENTS.md
frontend/CLAUDE.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets - API keys (Gemini/Groq/OpenRouter). NEVER commit these.
# `.env` at any depth is ignored above; worker.env files are not.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
worker.env
ocr-kit/keys.txt

# VM env copies must never be committed
*.env.vm
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example
tmp/

